{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301200","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1230120001:1":{"text":"あぁ、さっさと直して出航したいんだよ。だがどんなに焦っていようと順番は順番だ……","source_cn":"是的，想要修船出海的人实在太多。每个人都说急，可再怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F82F36465B790F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230120002:1":{"text":"俺は魚の値段が心配なんだ！市場での価格はコロコロ変わるからな、まさに「時は金なり」だ！","source_cn":"我是着急鱼的价格！现在鱼市的鱼价一天一变，时间就是金钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4726D6AA510CFC47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230120003:1":{"text":"時は金なり？だったら今まで何をしてたんだ？","source_cn":"时间就是金钱？那之前你去干什么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4473AFE6FF8FCC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230120004:1":{"text":"船を直してほしけりゃ、ルールを守って黙って列に並べ！","source_cn":"想要我修船，就守规矩，给我闭嘴去后面排好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BCE14870054B1C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠埃隆阿":{"text":"職人のエルノア","source":"工匠埃隆阿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:渔夫塔富林":{"text":"漁師のタフリン","source":"渔夫塔富林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}